        }
      }
    },
    "会议 %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meetings %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会议中顶栏的“提词 / 只记录”决定是否自动回答，默认值由会议类型决定（面试、汇报、客户沟通默认提词）。提词时，以问号或“吗 / 呢”结尾的问题约 0.6 秒内开始回答；拿不准的句子显示为可点击的“可能的问题”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Prompt / Notes only switch in the meeting's top bar decides whether answers appear automatically; the meeting type sets the default (interviews, presentations and client calls start in Prompt). In Prompt, questions are answered within about 0.6 seconds; unclear sentences show up as clickable “possible questions”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会议进行中不能切换语言。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
